# The build context is what the image's build stage needs and nothing else: the page's
# sources, the tools `tsc` checks beside them, and the server. Everything else, the game
# files above all, stays out (`doc/DEPLOYMENT.md`).
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!vite.config.mts
!index.html
!src/
!server/
!tools/**/*.ts
